{"id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-monad-algebras.md","title":"Definition — 单子代数范畴与自由代数","display":"Definition — 单子代数范畴与自由代数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-monad-algebras","aliases":["14-df-monad-algebras"],"display":"Definition — 单子代数范畴与自由代数","source_ref":"IV.4, pp.177–178; DjVu 94–95","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-monad]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-monad-algebras"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-monad-algebras</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 单子代数范畴与自由代数"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.4, pp.177–178; DjVu 94–95"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61a5bbf642ba9c20\" href=\"?note=61a5bbf642ba9c20\" title=\"14-df-monad\">14-df-monad</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\eta,\\mu)\">\\((T,\\eta,\\mu)\\)</span> 为范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上的单子。代数对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(A,a)\">\\(K=(A,a)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:T(A)\\to A\">\\(a:T(A)\\to A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L,H\">\\(K,L,H\\)</span> 为代数对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_T\">\\(\\beta_T\\)</span> 提取代数箭头的底层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_T,F_T\">\\(U_T,F_T\\)</span> 为以下遗忘、自由函子。Hom 双射固定对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(B,b)\">\\(L=(B,b)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 为代数态射、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to B\">\\(f:A\\to B\\)</span> 为环境箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_T=\\{(A,a)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(TA,A)\\land a\\circ\\eta_A=\\operatorname{id}_A\\land a\\circ T(a)=a\\circ\\mu_A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_T=\\{(A,a)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(TA,A)\\land a\\circ\\eta_A=\\operatorname{id}_A\\land a\\circ T(a)=a\\circ\\mu_A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_T=\\{((A,a),(B,b),f)\\mid(A,a),(B,b)\\in O_T\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land f\\circ a=b\\circ T(f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_T=\\{((A,a),(B,b),f)\\mid(A,a),(B,b)\\in O_T\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land f\\circ a=b\\circ T(f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_T((K,L,f))=K,\\quad c_T((K,L,f))=L,\\quad\\beta_T((K,L,f))=f,\\quad i_T((A,a))=((A,a),(A,a),\\operatorname{id}_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_T((K,L,f))=K,\\quad c_T((K,L,f))=L,\\quad\\beta_T((K,L,f))=f,\\quad i_T((A,a))=((A,a),(A,a),\\operatorname{id}_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_T((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f),\\qquad\\mathcal C^T=(O_T,M_T,d_T,c_T,i_T,\\gamma_T),\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,L)=\\{v\\in M_T:d_T(v)=K\\land c_T(v)=L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma_T((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f),\\qquad\\mathcal C^T=(O_T,M_T,d_T,c_T,i_T,\\gamma_T),\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,L)=\\{v\\in M_T:d_T(v)=K\\land c_T(v)=L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_{T,0}((A,a))=A,\\quad U_{T,1}((K,L,f))=f,\\quad F_{T,0}(A)=(TA,\\mu_A),\\quad F_{T,1}(f)=(F_{T,0}(A),F_{T,0}(B),T(f))\\quad(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_{T,0}((A,a))=A,\\quad U_{T,1}((K,L,f))=f,\\quad F_{T,0}(A)=(TA,\\mu_A),\\quad F_{T,1}(f)=(F_{T,0}(A),F_{T,0}(B),T(f))\\quad(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_T=(U_{T,0},U_{T,1}),\\qquad F_T=(F_{T,0},F_{T,1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_T=(U_{T,0},U_{T,1}),\\qquad F_T=(F_{T,0},F_{T,1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{A,L}(h)=\\beta_T(h)\\circ\\eta_A,\\qquad\\Psi_{A,L}(f)=(F_T(A),L,b\\circ T(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{A,L}(h)=\\beta_T(h)\\circ\\eta_A,\\qquad\\Psi_{A,L}(f)=(F_T(A),L,b\\circ T(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{A,L}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A),L)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B),\\qquad\\Psi_{A,L}=\\Phi_{A,L}^{-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{A,L}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A),L)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B),\\qquad\\Psi_{A,L}=\\Phi_{A,L}^{-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代数态射含完整代数源、靶标签。自由函子对箭头返回代数三元组，遗忘函子返回原环境箭头；Hom 双射的反向同样显式包装，以下等式证明对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_T\">\\(\\beta_T\\)</span> 提取的箭头适用。</p>\n<p>单子结合律、单位律说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_TA\">\\(F_TA\\)</span> 确为代数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 的自然性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(f)\">\\(T(f)\\)</span> 为代数态射。代数态射的恒等和复合满足同一交换关系。最后两个映射互逆：一个方向用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\eta=1\">\\(b\\eta=1\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 自然性，另一个方向用代数态射关系及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1\">\\(\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1\\)</span>。显式自然单位、余单位及三角式另由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"733785fa2bb6eb61\" href=\"?note=733785fa2bb6eb61\" title=\"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction\">14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction</a> 给出，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_T\\dashv U_T\">\\(F_T\\dashv U_T\\)</span>，并非只定义了对象集合而遗漏范畴态射。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，IV.4, pp.177–178。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-monad","status":"resolved","id":"61a5bbf642ba9c20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monad]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"733785fa2bb6eb61","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"单子结合律、单位律说明 $F_TA$ 确为代数；$\\mu$ 的自然性使 $T(f)$ 为代数态射。代数态射的恒等和复合满足同一交换关系。最后两个映射互逆：一个方向用 $b\\eta=1$ 与 $\\eta$ 自然性，另一个方向用代数态射关系及 $\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1$。显式自然单位、余单位及三角式另由 [[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]] 给出，所以 $F_T\\dashv U_T$，并非只定义了对象集合而遗漏范畴态射。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(T,\\eta,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"K=(A,a)","display":false},{"tex":"a:T(A)\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"K,L,H","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"U_T,F_T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"L=(B,b)","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"O_T=\\{(A,a)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(TA,A)\\land a\\circ\\eta_A=\\operatorname{id}_A\\land a\\circ T(a)=a\\circ\\mu_A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"M_T=\\{((A,a),(B,b),f)\\mid(A,a),(B,b)\\in O_T\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land f\\circ a=b\\circ T(f)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"d_T((K,L,f))=K,\\quad c_T((K,L,f))=L,\\quad\\beta_T((K,L,f))=f,\\quad i_T((A,a))=((A,a),(A,a),\\operatorname{id}_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma_T((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f),\\qquad\\mathcal C^T=(O_T,M_T,d_T,c_T,i_T,\\gamma_T),\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,L)=\\{v\\in M_T:d_T(v)=K\\land c_T(v)=L\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"U_{T,0}((A,a))=A,\\quad U_{T,1}((K,L,f))=f,\\quad F_{T,0}(A)=(TA,\\mu_A),\\quad F_{T,1}(f)=(F_{T,0}(A),F_{T,0}(B),T(f))\\quad(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)).","display":true},{"tex":"U_T=(U_{T,0},U_{T,1}),\\qquad F_T=(F_{T,0},F_{T,1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_{A,L}(h)=\\beta_T(h)\\circ\\eta_A,\\qquad\\Psi_{A,L}(f)=(F_T(A),L,b\\circ T(f)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_{A,L}:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A),L)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B),\\qquad\\Psi_{A,L}=\\Phi_{A,L}^{-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta_T","display":false},{"tex":"F_TA","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"T(f)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\eta=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1","display":false},{"tex":"F_T\\dashv U_T","display":false}],"bytes":2880,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monad-algebras|df-212 — 单子代数范畴与自由代数]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monad-algebras]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monad-algebras]]"},{"id":"552e996c15863488","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$、$G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ 是指定单位 $\\eta$、余单位 $\\varepsilon$ 的伴随数据，满足 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]] 的两条三角式。取 [[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]] 的 $T=GF$、$\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)})$。代数范畴及自由/遗忘函子见 [[14-df-monad-algebras]]。$D,D'$ 是 $\\mathcal D$ 对象；比较函子记 $\\mathsf K$，避免与代数对象的通用字母混同。单子性谓词保留所指定伴随的全部参数；范畴等价采用 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monad-algebras]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monad-algebras|df-212 — 单子代数范畴与自由代数]]"},{"id":"733785fa2bb6eb61","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":5,"excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上的单子。$\\mathcal C^T,F_T,U_T,\\beta_T$ 取 [[14-df-monad-algebras]] 的完整带标签编码。$A$ 遍历 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象，$K=(B,b)$ 遍历代数对象；$e^T_K$ 是下式构造的代数箭头。自然变换三元组、恒等/复合与伴随见所列内部依赖。$\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal A}$ 表示将 [[14-df-isomorphism]] 的环境范畴指定为 $\\mathcal A$。"},{"id":"34c430417768f1a0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上单子，$K=(A,a)$ 为 $T$ 代数。使用[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]的自由函子和[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的带标签箭头。余等化、反身对及分裂余等化的参数顺序见 [[14-df-split-coequalizer]]；这里的分裂数据在底层范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中，不预设它们都是代数态射。"}],"outgoing":["61a5bbf642ba9c20","733785fa2bb6eb61"]}